     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A factorial for any positive whole number <i>n</i> (denoted <i>n</i>!) is the product of every whole number less than or equal to <i>n</i>. We define 0! to be equal to one.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{8!}}{{4!4!}} = \\frac{{8 \\times 7 \\times 6 \\times 5 \\times \\cancel{{4!}}}}{{\\cancel{{4!}} \\times 4 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1}} = \\frac{{1,680}}{{24}} = 70\"></span></p>\n"
    },
